Package: badlm
Title: Bayesian Adaptive Distributed Lag Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alastair", "Rushworth", email = "alastairmrushworth@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits the Bayesian adaptive distributed lag model of Rushworth (2018)
    <arXiv:1801.06670>. The lag curve is represented by a B-spline basis whose
    coefficients receive a first-difference penalty with lag-varying precision,
    and the log precisions are themselves smoothed by a random walk prior, so
    that the amount of smoothing adapts to the shape of the lag curve.
    Inference is by Markov chain Monte Carlo.
License: GPL-2
Encoding: UTF-8
